@startuml
title PD-03 / Railway deployment for the Week 13 demonstration\nadded 30 October 2026, S5 since 1 November 2026; PD-02 (local) stays the fallback
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #27465B
skinparam nodeBorderColor #27465B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5D9
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 55

node "Presenter laptop\n(the demo machine)" as Laptop {
  node "Browser, two profiles\ncustomer and Founder" as Browser <<executionEnvironment>> #E4F2EB
  node "Railway CLI + tools/demo/demo.ps1\ncloud / cloud-fresh / cloud-tokens\ncloud-s5 / cloud-s5-show / cloud-s5-end" as Cli <<executionEnvironment>> #E4F2EB {
    artifact "tmp/railway-shop\nsessions, passwords, S5 key and receipt\nnever shown; deleted after use" as LocalSessions #E8EEF7
  }
}

cloud "Railway project" as Railway {
  node "Railway edge\npublic HTTPS address" as Edge <<executionEnvironment>> #E4F2EB
  node "Service: demo container\ntools/railway/Dockerfile\nnon-root UID 10001" as Service <<executionEnvironment>> #E4F2EB {
    artifact "start.py\nkeep or reset returnops_f02, alembic upgrade head,\nprovision or renew sessions, then supervise;\nS5 run before the demonstration,\nshown on request (s5 / s5-show / s5-end)" as Start #E4F2EB
    artifact "Caddy on PORT\nweb build /app/web\n/v1 and /health -> 127.0.0.1:8000,\nor to the driver's API while S5 is shown" as Caddy #E4F2EB
    artifact "demo.py serve 127.0.0.1:8000\nfixed proposal, Founder decisions,\naccounts, advisory model (Bailian)" as Api #E4F2EB
    artifact "R.02 driver, demo mode (S5)\ntools/r02; its API child on\n127.0.0.1:8100 or the next free port" as Driver #E4F2EB
    artifact "/app/private\ndemo-shop: auth.json, sessions.json\ns5: demo-cups identities, receipt" as Private #E8EEF7
  }
  node "Service: PostgreSQL 17\nsame image as compose.yaml, Railway volume\nprivate network only for the app" as Postgres <<executionEnvironment>> #E4F2EB {
    database "returnops_f02\nkept across deployments\n(cloud-fresh resets it)" as Database #E8EEF7
    database "returnops_f02_s5\ncreated fresh for each S5 run" as S5Database #E8EEF7
    database "returnops_f02_private\nthe kept private files" as PrivateStore #E8EEF7
  }
}

node "Not deployed here\nS4 over the course proxy (a private VPN address);\non Railway S4 uses Alibaba Cloud Bailian" as Elsewhere <<external>> #FFF3D6

Browser --> Edge : HTTPS, bearer token\nper browser profile
Edge --> Caddy : PORT
Caddy --> Api : loopback proxy
Caddy --> Driver : loopback proxy\nwhile S5 is shown
Start --> Private : writes
Start --> Driver : starts on s5,\nSIGINT on s5-end
Api --> Private : reads auth.json
Start --> Database : migrate (+ reset, provision)
Start --> S5Database : drop, create, migrate, provision
Start --> PrivateStore : restore + keep
Api --> Database : SQLAlchemy + psycopg
Driver --> S5Database : one cups case,\napproved and executed
Cli --> Service : railway up / redeploy\n(build from this folder)
Cli --> Private : railway ssh -- cat\n(stdout captured, not shown)
Cli --> Start : railway ssh --\nstart.py s5 / s5-show / s5-end
Cli --> LocalSessions : writes

note bottom of Service
A deployment keeps the previous one's data (31 October 2026);
cloud-fresh starts a fresh synthetic demonstration. S5 never
stops the demo API. No credential is printed; logs carry no
tokens; Caddy keeps no access log.
end note
@enduml
